{"c":[{"name":"20261005T143020Z-8eb592e9f22ab7a6","text":"H6: on-screen ghost runs type into a fresh TextEdit instance; caret-fixture's single-line field gave the host almost no value reads. With pid-posted keys both reader and host saw TextEdit's field come and go 20+ times in 130 keys.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T152850Z-7c0a9e0204dd886b","text":"H7b: in the rig guest, cua-driver get_window_state raises macOS's 'CuaDriver ... bypass the system private window picker' alert (UserNotificationCenter, layer 8); it stays up and covers windows, so Caret holds offers as covered. Read AX values with a17-tool value.","type":"note"}]}
